bu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Key-Visual-TR-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Key-Visual-TR-1536x864.webp 1536w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Key-Visual-TR-580x326.webp 580w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Key-Visual-TR-320x180.webp 320w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Key-Visual-TR.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></noscript></a><p>Paribu&rsquo;nun kriptoyla ba&#351;layan yolculu&#287;u yat&#305;r&#305;m d&uuml;nyas&#305;na geni&#351;liyor. Finansal ara&ccedil;lar DeFi eri&#351;imi, Borsa &#304;stanbul ve ABD borsalar&#305; canl&#305; veri ak&#305;&#351;&#305;, Getiri gibi &uuml;r&uuml;nlerle &ccedil;e&#351;itlenirken Paribu Pass, k&uuml;lt&uuml;r sanat ve e&#287;lence alan&#305;nda yeni bir biletleme deneyimi sunuyor.</p></div><div class="entry-footer">
