ttps://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-18-eylul-2026-768x384.webp 768w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-18-eylul-2026-580x290.webp 580w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-18-eylul-2026-320x160.webp 320w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-18-eylul-2026.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></noscript></a><p>SEC, tokenize hisselerin i&#351;lem g&ouml;rmesine izin verecek. CFTC, yaz&#305;l&#305;m sa&#287;lay&#305;c&#305;lar&#305;n&#305; arac&#305; kurum olarak kaydolma zorunlulu&#287;undan muaf tutuyor. Deutsche Bank, kripto varl&#305;k saklama hizmeti sunmay&#305; planl&#305;yor. Emirhan Erdo&#287;an, kripto varl&#305;k piyasalar&#305;ndaki son geli&#351;meleri &ouml;zetledi.</p></div><div class="entry-footer">
