g/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-16-eylul-2026-768x384.webp 768w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-16-eylul-2026-580x290.webp 580w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-16-eylul-2026-320x160.webp 320w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-16-eylul-2026.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></noscript></a><p>CLARITY baraj&#305; a&#351;amad&#305;. Piyasa tepkisi negatif oldu. Paribu, Arc'&#305;n T&uuml;rkiye'deki lansman partneri oldu. Emirhan Erdo&#287;an, son geli&#351;meleri Paribu G&uuml;ndem'de de&#287;erlendirdi.</p></div><div class="entry-footer">
