p-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-15-eylul-2026-768x384.webp 768w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-15-eylul-2026-580x290.webp 580w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-15-eylul-2026-320x160.webp 320w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/paribu-gundem-15-eylul-2026.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></noscript></a><p>CLARITY Act, T&uuml;rkiye saatiyle 21.15'te g&ouml;r&uuml;&#351;&uuml;lecek. ABD Temsilciler Meclisi Vergi Komitesi, 114 sayfal&#305;k bir kripto vergi yasa tasar&#305;s&#305; yay&#305;mlad&#305;. Almanya'da 2027'den itibaren kripto kazan&ccedil;lar&#305;n&#305; %25 oran&#305;nda vergilendirmeyi de&#287;erlendiriyor.</p></div><div class="entry-footer">
