og-v2-300x150.webp 300w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-1024x512.webp 1024w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-768x384.webp 768w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-1536x768.webp 1536w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-2048x1024.webp 2048w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-1920x960.webp 1920w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-580x290.webp 580w, https://www.paribu.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/hazir-sepetler-blog-v2-320x160.webp 320w" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px" /></noscript></a><p>Paribu, kullan&#305;c&#305;lar&#305;n tek i&#351;lemde birden fazla varl&#305;kta e&#351;it tutarl&#305; al&#305;m yapabildi&#287;i Haz&#305;r sepetler &ouml;zelli&#287;ini devreye ald&#305;. Kullan&#305;c&#305;lar tek seferlik haz&#305;r sepet al&#305;m&#305; yapabiliyor, dilerlerse haz&#305;r sepetler i&ccedil;in de D&uuml;zenli Al&#305;m talimat&#305; verebiliyor.</p></div><div class="entry-footer">
